  "i": 5,
  "text": "Why? Lesson three's wheel. Each sample, the dot turns forty-five degrees for every thousand hertz, and the sample is how far left or right it sits. Three thousand turns one hundred thirty-five degrees, to the upper left. The whistle turns two hundred twenty-five, past half a turn, to the lower left. Mirror spots, the same reading.",
